{"2719740": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Zero Caliber 2 Remastered", "steam_appid": 2719740, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>NEW CONTENT DROPPED - TOON SKINS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2719740/extras/4f26fbdfdd842124255d2b61bf766863.avif?t=1772655341\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >### <strong>THE SEQUEL</strong> ###</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your favorite all-in-one VR FPS is back - and it’s better in every way!<br><i>Zero Caliber 2 Remastered</i> is the full-blown sequel to the original, built on everything we learned during development and shaped by community feedback.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We’ve been giving it everything we’ve got to deliver the kind of VR shooter the <strong>PCVR community actually deserves</strong> - no lazy ports, no shortcuts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2719740/extras/7d855dc8c9c643ee73098a9921afc893.avif?t=1772655341\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2719740/extras_big/7d855dc8c9c643ee73098a9921afc893.webp?t=1772655341 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Expect intense, <strong>cinematic</strong> firefights, airstrikes, a <strong>massive</strong> arsenal to unlock, improved weapon handling, <strong>full campaign</strong> (<i>solo or co-op</i>), and head-to-head <i>PvP</i>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The story picks up right where the first game left off - only <strong>louder, faster, and more explosive</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >### <strong>COMMUNITY</strong> ###</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Want behind-the-scenes stuff, sneak peeks, and some chaotic dev energy?<br>Hop into our Discord, we’re in there when we aren't working on the release build - which is rare. Come join our community anyway! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2719740/extras/eeee1eda31df2f26c4cd8ba21ad65b75.avif?t=1772655341\" width=800 height=179 /></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>NEW CONTENT DROPPED - TOON SKINS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2719740/extras/4f26fbdfdd842124255d2b61bf766863.avif?t=1772655341\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >### <strong>THE SEQUEL</strong> ###</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your favorite all-in-one VR FPS is back - and it’s better in every way!<br><i>Zero Caliber 2 Remastered</i> is the full-blown sequel to the original, built on everything we learned during development and shaped by community feedback.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We’ve been giving it everything we’ve got to deliver the kind of VR shooter the <strong>PCVR community actually deserves</strong> - no lazy ports, no shortcuts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2719740/extras/7d855dc8c9c643ee73098a9921afc893.avif?t=1772655341\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2719740/extras_big/7d855dc8c9c643ee73098a9921afc893.webp?t=1772655341 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Expect intense, <strong>cinematic</strong> firefights, airstrikes, a <strong>massive</strong> arsenal to unlock, improved weapon handling, <strong>full campaign</strong> (<i>solo or co-op</i>), and head-to-head <i>PvP</i>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The story picks up right where the first game left off - only <strong>louder, faster, and more explosive</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >### <strong>COMMUNITY</strong> ###</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Want behind-the-scenes stuff, sneak peeks, and some chaotic dev energy?<br>Hop into our Discord, we’re in there when we aren't working on the release build - which is rare. Come join our community anyway! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2719740/extras/eeee1eda31df2f26c4cd8ba21ad65b75.avif?t=1772655341\" width=800 height=179 /></span></p>", "short_description": "Zero Caliber 2 Remastered brings the full VR shooter experience to PC - with intense, cinematic firefights, a full single player and Co-op campaign, PvP, a huge arsenal to unlock, and character customization to make you stand out. Jump in if you’re after a proper VR shooter. Out NOW!", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "reviews": "“ZERO CALIBER 2 REMASTERED REVIEW - The Return of Great VR Graphics”<br>Gamertag VR<br><br>“This Game is Getting a HUGE UPGRADE for PCVR!”<br>Beardo Benjo<br><br>“Zero Caliber 2 REMASTERED - The ULTIMATE Call of Duty VR Game?”<br>Mac In VR<br>", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2719740/94fa6c8b89605bd75bba386c399803be7d6c574e/header.jpg?t=1772655341", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2719740/f81b6d5080cee68a8b31cdae03c0b698691685ca/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1772655341", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2719740/f81b6d5080c